{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/296666-scion-origin-stories","id":296666,"title":"Scion Origin Stories?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-29T23:49:16-07:00","id":296666,"title":"Scion Origin Stories?","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\">Anyone got any good ideas for a Visitation that new Scions could receive? I came up with 2 and may have more later depending on ideas. Here's an origin story for a child of Ares and Odin.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Winning</b> the world heavy weight championship was supposed to be the happiest moment of your life. Perhaps it would have been if it wasn't for Him. You thought they were just an obsessed fan when they said you were a child of the gods, but you promptly called security when they began insisting they were your father. You stepped into the ring, thinking they were just some random stalker. But when your first punch took the champion's head clean off, your boxing career was destroyed instantly!<br /> <br /> You are a child of Ares, god of war, and you are one of the greatest boxers in the world. Only problem is that now mortals crumble like tissue paper under your blows. That's okay, though, you've got plenty of Titan Spawn who think they have a shot at being a contender!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>The</b> car accident was going to kill you, you knew that as you lay in your hospital bed and waited for the last of your strength to fade away. But late at night, after visiting hours, an old man with an eye patch came to you and gave you a lengthy tongue lashing about how you were being a lazy bastard and did not deserve to join the others in Valhalla. Thrusting a weapon into your hand, the man said if he caught you slacking off again, he'd beat the hell out of you. Then he vanished suddenly, and you came to realize that your wounds were healed completely!<br /> <br /> You are a child of Odin, a sibling to Thor, and apparently regarded as the &quot;lazy one&quot; of the family. You have to work extra hard to prove you're not weak and cowardly, and hopefully earn your way into your father's good graces.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 10-30-2014, 02:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T00:41:10-07:00","id":296727,"title":"","content":"Except for the sibling to Loki part they're both pretty good.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T00:50:48-07:00","id":296729,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>omenseer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/296666-scion-origin-stories?p=296727#post296727\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Except for the sibling to Loki part they're both pretty good.</div> </div> </div> </div>Half sibling, then. Or whatever it's called when someone is adopted into your family :P<br /> <br /> <br /> Who doesn't want to see the arguments that would erupt from that?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Loki:</b> You're a lazy bastard!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>You:</b> Well you're adopted!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 10-30-2014, 03:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T03:27:23-07:00","id":296842,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/296666-scion-origin-stories?p=296729#post296729\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Half sibling, then. Or whatever it's called when someone is adopted into your family :P<br /> <br /> <br /> Who doesn't want to see the arguments that would erupt from that?</div> </div> </div> </div>They're referring to the fact that Marvel is the Universe that has Thor and Loki as brothers. In the true Mythology Canon, Loki is Odin's Blood-Brother.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/606-aynie","name":"Aynie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar606_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T09:19:21-07:00","id":297177,"title":"","content":"how's this?<br /> <br /> All your girlfriends have always liked to tell you about their dreams and nightmares, particularly after sex. Your last one specifically preferred to sleep with you because something about you kept the recurring nightmares from coming. For w while you shrugged that off, but then you started to have the nightmare with her, until you literally killed the monster of her dreams IN her dreams. She woke up after that, but you continued to sleep, and a robed man in wings materialized before you in the dreamscape.<br /> <br /> You are a child of Morpheus, god of Dreams, and you have been tasked with protecting mortals from alien things that would make Freddy Krueger their prison bitch. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T10:55:32-07:00","id":297262,"title":"","content":"\u2022You always wondered who your real parents were. Mom and Dad found you on top of a freshly filled grave on the first day of spring, and you've always wondered. Growing up the child of a mortician, you've always been a bit odd, and figured you'd go into the family business simply for lack of a better option. Then one day, the dead started climbing out of their plots. When the strange man and woman came out of nowhere with swords and started chopping things up, you really were too busy fighting for your life to care. When, after the fight, they claimed to be your parrnts, you started paying attention. They were sorry to give you up, but Hades and Persephone were not exactly the best choices to give you a normal childhood. Now you wander the country, putting the unquiet dead to rest. It's the family business, after all. <br /> <br /> \u2022It was just you and your mom growing up. She was sick most of the time, so you tried to be good. Really, you did! But then you'd see some bully or thug causing people grief, strutting around like they owned everything, and you'd get so mad, and next thing you know, his pants are full of glue and you're in the principal's office. When you weren't growing into a vigilante, you spent you time in the library, reading of Odin, Thor, Loki, and the other lords of Midgard. Then mom got sick. Sicker than normal. You worked hard to pay the bills and pick up the slack, but she just grew worse and worse over the years. As she told you about your dad, how wonderful and perfect he was and how she wished she knew what made him grow away, you grew to hate your sire. Then, one day, she finally died. No other relatives, no friends, no one. You were her only tie to the world, and her yours. That day, your 21st birthday, you went to get drunk for the first(and last) time in your life. The old man behind the counter listened, felt pity, and offered you a drink. Next thing you know, it's morning, you're on the other side of the state, your body is covered in runic tattoos, and the old man is introducing himself as your grandfather, or, as you probably better know him, Loki Laufreyson. Your dad was a Scion like you, but he decided to desert the Titan War and go do whatever he wanted. You aren't going to be like him, and the war may be the only toe you have to the World. Regardless of the reason, there 's a lot of bullies strutting their stuff that only you can punish. Time to get out the glue... <br /> <br /> \u2022Growing up son of an unwed mother in the middle of the 20th century wasn't easy, but you managed. You learned to tune people out, to stop caring. You went into medicine more for the money than the chance to do a good thing. You grew old, cold and alone, and you liked it that way. Then, one day, a few weeks before you were going to retire, a man a little older than you came in with a patient. You were shocked and a little nauseated when you saw what his wounds looked like, and you weren't sure what animal could have mauled him like that. But, under the watchful, judging eye of the man, you fixed him up. That's when the Titanspawn lept into your clinic, eager to finish the job. The old man threw you a sword, and you proved yourself a natural as the monster tried in vain to not be chopped to bits. When the old man told you he was Dian C\u00e9cht of celtic lore, and you father, you were too weirded out to care. He told you about the Titans and the war, and asked if you wanted to fight. You wanted to tell him to go away, but a part of you, the Compassionate part you thought died a long time ago, reminded you of the boy you had just saved. You may have been a bitter old man, but you swore an oath, and you won't let anyone get hurt like that while you still breath.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T11:44:14-07:00","id":297286,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aynie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/296666-scion-origin-stories?p=296842#post296842\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They're referring to the fact that Marvel is the Universe that has Thor and Loki as brothers. In the true Mythology Canon, Loki is Odin's Blood-Brother.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>OoO<br /> <br /> Everything I know about Loki is a lie!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> -------------------------------------<br /> <br /> <br /> You've been called a matchmaker, a miracle worker, a love guru. For as long as you can remember, there has never been a marital problem you haven't been able to solve. Even the most chaotic marriages became stabilized after you provided them with your own counseling techniques. Then one day, a very angry couple shows up in your office. The husband is shouting that the wife has been unfaithful to him, while the wife flies into a seemingly endless list of women he has slept with during their marriage.<br /> <br /> After you finally get them to calm down, they explain the situation. The wife claims she is your biological mother, and when the father learned of your existence, he was furious. When you ask them who they are, the wife introduces herself as Hera, goddess of marriage, and the husband is Zeus! After the husband makes it very clear that you are no son of his, he storms out of the office, but the wife smiles triumphantly to herself.<br /> <br /> &quot;Bastard doesn't like when it happens to him!&quot; she says, before patting you on the knee and leaving politely.<br /> <br /> Since their visit, you've felt inspired, no, compelled to seek out failing marriages and repair the situation. But it's more than that, you're ability to repair the situation is nothing short of miraculous. Even the most critically aclaimed marriage counselers would be awe struck by your ability to turn a couple who are two insults away from killing each other into one of the most compassionate and loving relationships! This, of course, doesn't please the monsters who feed on disruptive relationships, and they want you out of the picture.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 10-30-2014, 03:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T11:49:21-07:00","id":297289,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/296666-scion-origin-stories?p=297286#post297286\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> OoO<br /> <br /> Everything I know about Loki is a lie!</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, Yes it is. For example, he isn't actually locked up for killing Balder in some myths. In those, he forced into eternal torment for winning a rap contest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T12:05:03-07:00","id":297321,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/296666-scion-origin-stories?p=297289#post297289\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, Yes it is. For example, he isn't actually locked up for killing Balder in some myths. In those, he forced into eternal torment for winning a rap contest.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not surprised. Everybody knows the viking gods preferred heavy metal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T14:33:34-07:00","id":297512,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/296666-scion-origin-stories?p=297321#post297321\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm not surprised. Everybody knows the viking gods preferred heavy metal.</div> </div> </div> </div>You'd think, wouldn't you? In fact, the rap battle, known to the Norse as Flyting, was a sacred, respected means of settling differences, and considered the true mark of a skilled bard.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T14:42:58-07:00","id":297519,"title":"","content":"Too bad for him. Instigating rap-beef is one of the cornerstones of a successful career...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-18T16:16:08-08:00","id":374540,"title":"","content":"<b>Return of the King:</b> Your father took his Egyptian heritage quite seriously and was adamant that you came from the bloodline of ancient pharaohs. When he died, he even went so far as to commission an elaborate tomb be constructed for his final resting place. While you and the rest of your family went to mourn him, the tomb was sealed up behind you, as is royal burial custom! It was then you received your visitation from Osiris, who explained you were, indeed, descended from his blood. He gave you a choice; be entombed forever with your father, or embrace your heritage as the next Pharaoh. Leaving your relatives to starve to death may have been hard upon your conscience, but you'll see them again in the next world. Besides, Osiris didn't sound pleased about his empire crumbling to ruins, so you've got some work to do!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Afro Samurai:</b> It was practically unheard of, the Amatsukami are usually xenophobic towards other ethnicities. But Hachiman, the Lord of War, was impressed by your village's ability to fend off tribal warriors and animal poachers alike. You're fairly certain Hachiman only adopted you into the family, but it doesn't matter now. Your &quot;father&quot; has elevated you from being a simple village protector. Can you overcome the culture shock and make a name for yourself as a true warrior, or will this adoption spark a war between the Amatsukami and the Loa?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Sacrificial Victims:</b> You thought you were going insane, degrading into a serial killer. Who knows how much money you blew on counseling and medication before you finally stopped caring? You cannibalized two dozen people before the police finally caught you. Sentenced to death, you were awaiting the gas in the chamber before he game to you. Miclantecuhtli, the Aztec god of the dead. He gives you a choice, either suffocate to death in the execution chamber, or embrace your destiny as a bringer of death and despair. You had to laugh at the offer when it was presented. Many psychopaths have claimed theirs was a divine calling, but you can't think of any who had the opportunity to prove it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-20T08:24:25-08:00","id":376267,"title":"","content":"<b>Humble</b> <b>Beginnings</b> is an understatement when you look back on your stint as a mortal. You were below average in strength, not particularly intelligent, and woefully lacking in social graces. When your visitation came, you had mixed feelings between shock, anger, and excitement. You finally have a chance to make something of yourself, but your previous days as a loser makes your training require more effort than your distant relatives.<br /> <br /> This origin comes with its own flaw, in that the character has half the normal amount of points to spend on their character sheet during creation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T07:05:02-07:00","id":523139,"title":"","content":"You always were strange child. Storms didn't bother you, and you had perfect sight in night as well as day. You could outstare Sun.When others played with ball, you read books, and dreamed of magic. Your single parent, your mother didn't allow it, despite strange things happening to you both-animals following you, keys levitating, things dissapearing. You weren't very pretty and you were bullied. In time, all of bullies dissapeared. Then one day beasts attacked you. You saw your mother call lighting from sky and tear land open. With wave, you turned one in stone and sent one flying. As you and your mother laid dying, figure approached you. Ancient crone, thin as bone, with giant nose, wild hair, teeth of iron and leg of metal and wood. Stories helped you-you recognised her. For you, her name was true. Your grandmother healed you, and you jumped in her mortar, healing in chicken-legged hut, and learning all of magic you loved and your Scion mother hated. Now it's time to put it in use. Others may be doubly stronger, but you have skill. And you will continue family tradition- Titanspawn will hear tales about you when their wretched parents wish them to behave.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6005-coolcat12345","name":"coolcat12345","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T10:44:06-07:00","id":523474,"title":"","content":"<b>Setting It Straight:</b> Unlike the rest of the modern society who get their mythology teachings from movies and television series, you actually picked up a book once in a while. That's how you know that Hades is not the Greek Satan, and Zeus is definitely not the benevolent god he is portrayed as. Unfortunately, it seemed all your protesting did was fall on deaf ears, as more interpretations continued to support the popular belief of today over the actual version of the story. Then one day, somebody stopped to listen, interested in hearing your side of the tale. They smiled and nodded with interest about various points and stories you recounted about Zeus and Hades' deeds. You explained that Hades was never tricked into getting the underworld, he chose to rule it and he was quite happy with his station. When you finished your little tirade, the figure stroked their chin and spoke for the first time since your story began.<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;You're pretty passionate about this, aren't you? Tell you what, why don't you help restore some pride to your lineage?&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> With that, the man picked up his hat from the park bench you two had been sitting on and placed it on his head, vanishing from sight immediately upon doing so!<br /> <br /> <br /> You are a child of Hades, lord of the underworld, and NOT an allegory for the king of evil. You've taken it upon yourself to clear your father's name and prove that Hades is one of the most respectable and fair members Dodekatheon. It will be difficult though, most people hear the term &quot;underworld&quot; and think you're some demon spawn lusting after power and conquest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T12:11:01-07:00","id":523563,"title":"","content":"You haven't exactly led what one may call a charmed life.<br /> <br /> Oh, that's not to say you've been living like a Dickens character. You've got a loving family. Your Mom passed away when you were a baby and your dad apparently never even showed up for the funeral, much less to take care of you, so you were raised by your Grandparents, who put their all into raising you. But you were still always getting in trouble. When you were a kid, it was because you had a big mouth and were too clever by half and were always at the head of your friends, leading them into one adventure or another. When you were older, it tended to be because plenty of guys didn't like the way their sisters or girlfriends looked at you. Your mouth didn't help either. People loved you or hated you, but rarely did they not have an opinion.<br /> <br /> Still, for every good thing that happened, trouble never seemed far behind.<br /> <br /> For instance, you finally scored a date with the girl you've had your eyes on for a while and your grandmother passed away the next day. And with her gone, all the fire and life in your Grandfather seem to have gone with her.<br /> <br /> A few weeks later, you were out on a walk hoping the night air would help clear your head of the depression and frustration when you came across a woman being attacked by what looked at first glance like a guy in a trench coat. Well, that sort of shit doesn't fly when you're around and you charged him. Very quickly, you found out that he was much bigger than you thought.....and had one eye.<br /> <br /> You didn't mean he was missing an eye. You meant &quot;He had a giant fucking eyeball in the middle of his forehead.&quot;<br /> <br /> He was also hella stronger than you and spent a good while demonstrating that on your poor body. For a brief moment, you thought you were gonna die and be with Grams again. Then you took a look at the woman you came to save and decided that there wasn't a chance in hell you were dying like this. Strength surged through you in a hot wave and you felt your body ripple and expand and an instant later, you were a giant bear.<br /> <br /> Turns out, Bear &gt; Cyclops.<br /> <br /> After you turned back to normal, the woman, not a single hair so much as ruffled comes over and takes you aside for a talk.<br /> <br /> She explains that you're a Scion, a child of the gods, like out of one of the old stories. She tells about the monsters and magic of the world. Then she tells you that you have your father's eyes.<br /> <br /> Now, normally you wouldn't exactly be terribly interested in who your dad was, except maybe to know what he looks like so you could punch him in the face one day, but after learning that he's apparently a god it's sorta hard <i>not</i> to be interested. Besides, you couldn't really think of any gods who turned into bears off the top of your head.<br /> <br /> &quot;Most of your father's demigod children inherit his great strength or at times, his thunder.&quot; She said. &quot;But Zeus is also a skilled shapeshifter and you seem to take after him in that regard.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Zeus...King of the Gods Zeus?&quot; You ask &quot;Father of Hercules Zeus?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, that Zeus.&quot; The woman says distastefully, her eyebrow twitching briefly at the mention of Hercules.<br /> <br /> A sudden horrible premonition cuts through the fog of confusion you've been in since the whole bear thing and you hesitantly ask the woman who she is.<br /> <br /> &quot;It's about time you asked.&quot; she said. &quot;I am Hera, Queen of the Gods.&quot;<br /> <br /> Oh. Shit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T19:32:37-07:00","id":523855,"title":"","content":"That...was bloody brilliant story!<br /> <br /> I so want to steal it now","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2295-coderr","name":"CodeRR","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2295_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T20:24:53-07:00","id":523933,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CodeRR</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/296666-scion-origin-stories?p=523855#post523855\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That...was bloody brilliant story!<br /> <br /> I so want to steal it now</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> By all means, go right ahead.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-21T00:00:12-07:00","id":634327,"title":"","content":"You always wanted to be a rockstar growing up, so during your last birthday you were pleased to receive a guitar in the shape of a giant battle axe. It looked awesome at first, but then you realized that blade on the end is very much real and for some reason playing the instrument conjures fire and lightning into existence! It was about this time you realized you never actually learned who gave you the present. It was just placed on the table with the rest of your gifts. As you returned to the present table, you found an envelope addressed to you where the guitar had previously been. Opening it up, you found a card wishing you a happy birthday, from Loki!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-21T02:34:45-07:00","id":634380,"title":"","content":"Huh, funny, that was actually very close to one of my players' backstory. Except that it was a son of Thor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-21T22:07:09-07:00","id":635444,"title":"","content":"I admit all these stories remind me of short stories I wrote with different Visitations. If people want I can put some of them up here or write up new ones or even write shorter version in the style that has been written here already","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/601-dioscuri","name":"Dioscuri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T05:10:46-07:00","id":635616,"title":"","content":"Please do. ^_^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T11:33:17-07:00","id":636099,"title":"","content":"<b>The Stars</b>: You have always been fascinated by them, in a sort of wary, cautious sort of way. You always felt like there was something more to them. While earning your PhD in Astronomy, specializing in the dead stars known as black holes, you read everything you could on stars, from ancient mythology to the writings of H.P. Lovecraft. Astronomy documentaries were the only thing you ever watched on TV, but nothing seemed to satisfy your curiosity. Then, on the night of your graduation, drinking cocktails out of beakers passed out by the chem graduates, you were approached by a man with a slight limp and a leopard spotted tie.<br /> <br /> &quot;I must admit, this is certainly not the path I expected of you when I sired you. Still, you could be a useful warrior against the tzitzimimeh.&quot;<br /> <br /> You knew that name. It was the name of the star demons in Aztec mythology that continually tried to eat the sun. With a growing apprehension, you cautiously ask the man who he is.<br /> <br /> With a fang filled grin, the man simply responds: &quot;Your father, the Black Tezcatlipoca.&quot;<br /> <br /> ...you really shouldn't have drank that half-pint of Four Horsemen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7395-meribson","name":"Meribson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7395_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-28T15:13:34-07:00","id":643452,"title":"","content":"<b>Love and Lust</b>: Two things that you have always endeared in those around you. Combined with winning the genetic lottery as far as your looks were concerned, and you always had it pretty easy as far as the opposite sex, and to a lesser degree the same sex, was concerned. The thing is, you didn't want to go into modeling or fashion. The idea of trying on different clothes that you'd never wear for a few pictures just doesn't appeal to you, besides you'd much rather a simple tee-shirt and jeans than anything fancy.<br /> <br /> When you were eighteen, you stumbled (almost literally) into a job that you didn't expect to love: adult entertainment. Your first job was in front of a camera doing a softcore short-film. From there your career took off. Five years, and having starred in adult films of almost every type and fetish imaginable, later you were one of the fastest rising porn stars in the world. Of course with your job came certain inevitable illnesses, but upon being diagnosed you made a choice that could have seriously hampered your career: you refused to star with a coworker that was free of STDs.<br /> <br /> Then at the age of 24, after finishing your first film directing at a bar that you frequent to relax after stressful days at work, you were approached by a woman whose beauty put any and all of your coworkers to shame. Ignoring everyone else in the bar, she came right up to you and whispered in your ear a piece of information that rang true in the deepest core of your being.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;My name is Venus, and you are my child.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> ...and now you felt dirty for ogling her. <hr />Okay, I tried to keep anything explicit out and keep the origin story gender neutral. If I was not successful enough I will edit it and make it more vague.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7395-meribson","name":"Meribson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7395_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-28T18:52:03-07:00","id":643682,"title":"","content":"<b>90's Kid:</b> Ah the 90's, the last memorable decade when kids were interested in physical activity instead of glued to their screens all day. Everything was <i>extreme</i>, especially sports. Your favorite stunt was the full pipe down at the skate park, flying around on your board and pulling a full 360 degree loop never got old. Well one day you had a crazy idea, you would pull a full loop on the half pipe instead. Everyone at the park thought it was impossible, claiming you'd wipe out or worse get yourself killed. But hey, this was the 90's, and common sense was for chickens! So you went ahead and tried your little stunt and... somehow you pulled it off. You went flying into the air on one side and came back down on the other in a perfect landing! At first, you thought everyone was standing still in dumbstruck awe, but it soon became apparent they were frozen in time. You turned around in reflex to see a man sitting on a grind rail with a smile on his face and a cowboy hat held over his chest in solute.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;My name is Pecos Bill&quot;</i> he introduced himself, &quot;<i>And I'd like to have a word with you!&quot; </i><br /> <br /> The next thing you know, he's handing you the most tricked out board you've ever seen, and it's got an awesome picture of a tornado painted on it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 08-28-2015, 09:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T14:59:54-08:00","id":774290,"title":"","content":"<b>Obnoxious Otaku:</b> Raiden may not be the most socially acceptable God of the Amatsukami, but at least his behavior makes some degree of sense when considering he's a mighty God of Lightning and plays by his own rules. Yours, however, have brought the Gods no end of public shame ever since your visitation. Being an advent fan of anime and manga, you view your Scion role as a chance to live out your greatest fantasies, making obscure references to your favorite series and the embarrassing habit of announcing names every time you utilize your Boons in the presence of witnesses. These names are so theatrical that you often forget them, inventing new ones on the spot!<br /> <br /> While the rest of the Amatsukami think you're an immature child, Raiden has decided to humor you with a couple birthrights. A wooden Katana that allows you to channel the Sky purview, and an everlasting stick of deodorant that allows you to draw upon the Guardian purview as long as you're wearing it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-05T21:16:49-08:00","id":780894,"title":"","content":"I work the late shift which means when I head for home the streets are usually dark and quiet, no big deal but one night while traversing a particularly empty stretch of street I had the misfortune to run into three fellows that seriously made me rethink that whole descended from monkeys thing. They had been drinking enough liquid courage that they decided I looked like easy prey. Now I'm no shrinking violet and I was quite proud to note that when the fight ended with me down on my knees, the Neanderthals were down on their bellies. Apparently the old man was so easily impressed as this guy with a grey beard, eye patch and a thing for chewed leather suddenly shows up and proceeds to wailing on me, all the time berating me as a 'severe disappointment, being taken down by three measly mortals'. Honestly at this point I wasn't up for much of fight and when the old bastard stuck his finger in my eye, which by the way really hurt, I'm pretty sure I blacked out for a minute. Least the last thing I remember is him telling me to 'make myself useful' and when I looked again he was gone. I don't know maybe it was the pain from having him digging around in my eye socket but I seemed to have gotten my second wind so I climbed to my feet, kicked one the drunken bastards for good measure, then stumbled my way home to fall face first into bed. When I woke up I still felt sore though I could see just fine, in fact better than I ever could before, in spite of having a smooth black stone with runes carved in the shape of an iris in place of my left eye. The raven says its a stone from the bottom of Mimir's well, whoever he happens to be. Oh yeah, I also have this crazy talking black bird following me around that no one else can see or hear and it won't shut up. It tells me that the old man was Odin Allfather, including my father, and that his enemies are also mine. That's right, when the old geezer was digging my eye out with his greasy fingers he was also hanging a big 'kick me' sign on my back that said 'kill me first' and now wherever I go there is some butt ugly abomination waiting with one foot cocked and ready. I'm getting stronger though and one day I will be the one assailing the Biofrost bridge and I will walk right up to Odin, look him straight in his one good eye, and spit in it. Then we'll see how easy he finds me to kick around when I'm still standing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"942"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T06:00:03-08:00","id":781094,"title":"","content":"<b>The Cleaner:</b> Some might call you a glorified janitor, and that's not exactly untrue. Your career involves cleaning up the messes people leave behind; you like to imagine you're helping people move on with their lives, but the truth is you're just covering for others mistakes. Most of the time you were just cleaning up after a hard night of partying, or putting away lab equipment used in the testing of science and medicine. But every now and then you'd get a shady job, well okay, more like a pitch black job. Your clients would sometimes hire you to dispose of critical evidence including bodies, weapons, DNA, whatever might cause others to suspect they were involved in a crime. Then your last client approached you with an offer, you either work exclusively for him, or he'll feed your heart to some kind of crocodile....hippo...lion thing.<br /> <br /> The client was Anubis, the Egyptian god of the dead, and in addition to being your only existing client for the foreseeable future, they are also your father. The war between Scions and Titanspawn can get messy and your father wants somebody to help clean up the mess and mitigate the political fallout of monsters and god-children battling it out in the modern age.<br /> <br /> The Pesedjet already has a Jackal, but now it looks like they're getting a Vulture, too!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T17:26:38-08:00","id":783777,"title":"","content":"<b>Lover AND Fighter: </b>Since you were a child, you could make people swoon over you. All you had to do was bat your eyes or show a toothy grin and everyone was falling all over themselves to give you what you wanted. In school, other children were distracted because everyone wanted to look at you. This only got worse around puberty, when boys and girls alike had to take cold showers to recover from a day in class next to you.<br /> High School was no different, except that you'd actually take your admirers to bed when the desire struck you. Even the guys secretly admired you, hoping you would notice them every bit as much as the ladies.<br /> This finally came back to haunt you when you were caught by the star quarterback's girlfriend behind the school at prom, screwing her boyfriend! His reputation was ruined, and he set out with his friends to destroy you. They came back out to jump you, baseball bat in hand, when suddenly you were whisked away by a parent chaperone you'd never seen before.<br /> She introduced herself as <i>your </i>mother, in fact, and claimed that she was Aphrodite, Greek goddess of love! With you safely away from the others, she gave you a charmed bracelet and bid you <i>adieu</i>, leaving you your own devices.<br /> Graduated and on your own now, you're living the high life, convincing others to give you whatever you ask, never working hard when you can receive it from somebody else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10163-toomuchjesus","name":"Toomuchjesus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T17:56:09-08:00","id":783801,"title":"","content":"<b>\u200bGone All Wrong: </b>Your childhood was... Well, it sucked. In a nutshell, when you weren't fighting with another kid or in trouble <i>for</i> fighting with another kid, you were brooding about how mad you were.<br /> And you were mad. All the time. Like an anger towards everyone and everything just made you want to lash out at whatever (or whoever) was closest. You lived in an orphanage almost your whole life, since foster homes never worked out with your hostile disposition. You even went to juvie once for putting another foster kid in the hospital.<br /> The ones you were mad at most though were your parents. Your mom, for up and dying when you were only two years old, and your dear old dad for leaving for the army and never coming home. Honorable discharge and all, he just... left. No call, no postcards, no notes on birthdays, just gone.<br /> And so, you've been mad. You aren't exactly the smartest in the bunch, either, since sitting in a classroom makes your blood boil and the only class you've ever passed in high school was gym. You joined the wrestling team and excelled, you'd even have gone all state, if you hadn't been dropped for bad grades. You were stronger and better than any wrestler on the team. Or anyone else's, for that matter. You ended up flunking out, and never heading back home to the orphanage after.<br /> Which is why you were wandering around, freshly 18, not a dime to your name, in an alley when a sketchy dude with black eyes offered you a place in an underground fight. You took him up, and made a couple hundred bucks for beating a guy into the ground. Now that's a line of work you could get behind.<br /> After the fight, sketchy guy told you he knew of your father, and your blood ran hot again. He told you the bastard was Ares, a fuckin' Greek God, and that he knew perfectly well who you are. He just never bothered to check in on you.<br /> So he offered you something else. A black coat with a clock insignia on it, a pair of shiny new, blood red brass knuckles, and entrance into what he called Missionaries of Kronus. Some sort of group out to destroy those working with and for the gods, gods just like dear old dad.<br /> So now you make your living fighting in basement rings for money. And when another godkid like you shows up, you beat them even harder.<br /> <br /> (I figured I'd include a visitation for somebody who's an emissary of the Titans. It's a pretty cool story idea and it gives some insight to why a scion might choose the dark side even after knowing where they come from.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10163-toomuchjesus","name":"Toomuchjesus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}